## What This Is

A minimal **Solid-based authentication + profile debug display** for the Tafel Calendar app. This is the first step—no calendar UI yet, no CRUD operations, just:

1. ✅ OIDC login (any Solid Pod provider)
2. ✅ Fetch user's Solid profile
3. ✅ Display 7 key parameters for debugging
4. ✅ Logout + refresh

**Inspired by:** [solid-note-experiment](https://github.com/ewingson/solid-note-experiment) pattern (simple HTML + vanilla JS, no frameworks).

