## Debugging Tips

**Check browser console** (F12 → Console):
- Look for error messages
- Logs show which fetches succeed/fail
- `console.warn()` or `console.error()` indicate network issues

**Common errors:**

| Error | Cause | Fix |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `CORS error` | Your HTTP server not running | Use `python3 -m http.server 8000` |
| `OIDC issuer not found` | Invalid Pod provider URL | Use full URL: `https://solidweb.org` |
| `Profile document empty` | User's profile not readable | Check Pod permissions (ACL) |
| Blank debug fields | Predicate not found in profile | Check if Pod stores that metadata |

